      "contextFingerprint": "8b765b1271eafd267fce11e1ae01577b0fc038c9f1a08c14f6c76455068833d2",
      "sourceText": "- 智能指针是 RAII 的典型应用。\n- `unique_ptr` 表达独占所有权，是默认首选。\n- `shared_ptr` 表达共享所有权，不要因为方便就滥用。\n- `weak_ptr` 不拥有对象，常用于解决循环引用。\n- 智能指针最重要的不是\"自动 delete\"，而是把所有权关系写清楚。",
      "translatedText": "- Smart pointers are a typical application of RAII\\.\n- `unique_ptr` It expresses exclusive ownership and is the default first choice\\.\n- `shared_ptr` It expresses shared ownership; do not abuse it just because it is convenient\\.\n- `weak_ptr` It does not own the object and is often used to resolve circular references\\.\n- The most important thing about smart pointers is not \"automatic delete,\" but making ownership relationships clear\\.",
